like the celebrity that I've never met,

6
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.630
who I've always wanted to meet, I always say her,

7
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.634
I just love her, because she reminds me of my mom,

8
00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:18.450
they have the same haircut and she cooks like my mom.

9
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.920
I just love you.

10
