15
00:00:30.547 --> 00:00:33.696 line:15%
I know, Ina Garten, the Barefoot Contessa, what?

16
00:00:33.696 --> 00:00:36.270 line:15%
Well, despite being one of the most famous chefs

17
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.990 line:15%
