37
00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.000
I just think like, oh wow, that's really refreshing to hear

38
00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:26.660
that I think we all go through, you know,

39
00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.681
just such inner voices,

40
00:01:28.681 --> 00:01:32.160
that we have to kind of figure out how to master.

41
00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:35.035
They're not doing us many favors a lot of the time

42
00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:38.220
