43
00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:41.090
that's there to test us to help us evolve

44
00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:44.779
and grow strong and figure out how to find that confidence.

45
00:01:44.779 --> 00:01:46.570
And you just look at someone like her

46
00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:49.150
