49
00:01:54.623 --> 00:01:57.015
and it's a big part of the journey of life,

50
00:01:57.015 --> 00:02:00.910
because sometimes I'm like, it is so crazy in here,

51
00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:04.100
that to hear Ina Garten struggles sometimes,

52
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.260
I'm like, oh, okay, well, maybe we all do.

53
00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:08.930
Yeah, yeah, someone who's as good at what she does,

54
00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:10.900
